<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Taeil Media H1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Taeil Media H1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				   684  vs 577</p>
<p>    Net					  6.68  vs 5.62</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			9.98  vs 7.49</p>
<p>    Revenue				  285.66  vs 146.45</p>
<p>NOTE - Taeil Media Co Ltd, established as a venture capital company, manufactures a variety of computer parts. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
